WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.500
I type: “Maknae, bring me the remote from the desk and hand it to me.”

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The request becomes a tool call. Nav2 plans the route to the desk.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:44.500
The front camera detects the desk marker and the robot aligns with it.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.000
The overhead camera sees the remote. The arm moves into position.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The gripper closes and lifts the remote.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Nav2 brings the robot back to the starting pose.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Maknae opens the gripper to hand over the remote.
